    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d928">

                <pb facs="0949" n="861" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg861"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Finch to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo,
                                Uruguay</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-12-19"><hi rendition="#italic">December 19,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 798.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose translation from the Montevideo
                    Daily Siglo headed “Our relations with Argentina—The incident terminated—The
                    protocol signed.”</p>
                <p>The Secretary will observe that the parties to this pact have apparently sought
                    to restore the external official relations existing between the two Republics
                    previous to the recent revolution in Uruguay.</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William R. Finch.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d928-a1.xml" xpointer="d928-a1"/>
